  "messages": [
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 0,
      "text": "привет, Kai! у меня новости про брата"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 1,
      "text": "Привет, Вера! Рассказывай."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 2,
      "text": "Ярослав наконец-то стал капитаном в авиакомпании, будет летать на A320"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 3,
      "text": "Поздравляю Ярослава! Это большой шаг."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 4,
      "text": "да, и они с Дашей уже переехали из Казани в Самару, там у них база"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 5,
      "text": "Значит, теперь они в Самаре. Как Даша к этому относится?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 6,
      "text": "Даша рада, у неё там родители"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 8,
      "text": "кстати, у нас новая соседка, Яра, въехала в квартиру напротив"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 9,
      "text": "она работает в пекарне на Ленина, принесла нам круассаны"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 10,
      "text": "Как мило с её стороны!"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 11,
      "text": "ага. а у нас ливень весь день, всё затопило во дворе"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 12,
      "text": "Надеюсь, ливень скоро закончится!"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 13,
      "text": "switching to english, my keyboard is being weird"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 14,
      "text": "Yaroslav also wants to fly us to Samara for New Year, his treat"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 15,
      "text": "That's generous of him! Would you go?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 16,
      "text": "probably, if work lets me. Brightwell is chaos in december"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 17,
      "text": "Pharmacies do get busy then. Are you still on the morning shifts there?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 18,
      "text": "yes, mornings till march"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 20,
      "text": "oh and I finally booked the dentist, thursday 9am"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 21,
      "text": "Good, that's been on your list for a while."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 22,
      "text": "don't remind me 😬"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 30,
      "text": "question: Yara asked if we know a good plumber, do you remember the one we used?"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 31,
      "text": "I don't have a plumber saved for you, sorry, I can't find one in my notes."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 32,
      "text": "ah ok, I'll ask Yaroslav, he knows everyone"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 33,
      "text": "he says Pavel Mirtov, the guy from Kazan, but he only works there"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 34,
      "text": "Then he won't help with a plumber here. Want me to look for local options?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 35,
      "text": "no worries, Yara will find someone"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 40,
      "text": "last thing: Dasha is pregnant!! due in April, Yaroslav is over the moon"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 41,
      "text": "That's wonderful news for Yaroslav and Dasha!"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 42,
      "text": "I'm going to be an aunt 🥹"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 43,
      "text": "Congratulations, Aunt Vera!"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 44,
      "text": "haha ok, bedtime. спокойной ночи"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 45,
      "text": "Спокойной ночи, Вера!"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_vera",
      "minute": 46,
      "text": "🙂"
    }
